```js
const i = Math.floor((x + scene.radius) / scene.cell);
const j = Math.floor((scene.radius - y) / scene.cell);
if (i < 0 || j < 0 || i >= scene.g || j >= scene.g) return -1;
return j * scene.g + i;
```
  Confirms `+y` is north and `-1` means outside the venue grid.

